# Board Validation

Require a successful build result, matching artifact digest and active owned lease.

1. Deploy the artifact using the lease-bound adapter.
2. Boot the leased board with the approved profile.
3. Run the bounded validation suite.
4. Record evidence with phase, operation ID, SHA-256 and sanitized locator.
5. Release or clean up the lease.
6. Return pass/fail without deleting evidence from completed phases.

Never select a different board or retry a non-idempotent operation outside the domain policy.
